Escalation Routing admin: tier-2 manager contact field.

The backend has accepted escalation_manager_email since P2 task 7, but the
admin page had no field for it -- an operator could only set it by curling
PUT /admin/escalation/pics/<dept>, which is not a workflow anyone will use.

Adds the field to the create form, the inline edit row and the table, and
shows "PIC (fallback)" when unset so the fallback behaviour is visible
rather than looking like missing data.

